*Question:*  Briefly describe one concrete thing you will proactively do to work on building trust  with your partner when communicating.

*Answer:* If I had to choose something perhaps positive feedback? Telling them thanks or genuinely complimenting their ideas, that kind of thing. I can be very critical on the idea of AI but I want Davyd to still know that I value his effort and his knowledge. I'm already doing this, but I want to keep it going and keep it as as priority. 

