*Question:*  Briefly describe one concrete thing you will proactively do to work on more productive communication with your partner

*Answer:* I will ask Davyd what he thinks more often, and also ask him for help on things. I can be independent to a fault and can forget to include people on things, so I want Davyd to feel included on the work and like we're actually a team. 
